ning the peculiar statue in the middle of the market squar\u2026   > west\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[2mlast refusal: not_ready\u001b[0m                                                                              Entrance to the Grunting Boar Inn\u001b[K\r\n                                                                                                          You are standing in the entrance hall of the Grunting Boar Inn.  The hall\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[2m-- session -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\u001b[0m   has been wisely decorated with simple but functional furniture.  A small\u001b[K\r\n  state       READY\u001b[2m  prompt -\u001b[0m                                                                          staircase leads up to the reception and the bar is to the east.\u001b[K\r\n  duration    7 min\u001b[2m  since this session opened\u001b[0m\u001b[K\r\n  commands    12\u001b[2m  refused 1\u001b[0m                                                                            >\u001b[K\r\n  stopped     \u001b[2mnot stopped\u001b[0m                                                                              You are hungry.\u001b[K\r\n                                                                                                       You are thirsty.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[2m-- learning  19 facts, 1 procedures ----------------------------------------------------------------\u001b[0m\u001b[K\r\n  Graveyard of Midgaard at the iron grate on the Concourse - bronze sign warns not \u2026\u001b[2m  [place,npc]\u001b[0m      > west\u001b[K\r\n  Market Square: large peculiar statue in middle. Roads lead north to temple square, so\u2026\u001b[2m  [place]\u001b[0m      The Temple Square\u001b[K\r\n  Clerics Guild entrance: small room with knight templar guarding. Exit leads east \u2026\u001b[2m  [place,npc]\u001b[0m         You are standing on the temple square.  Huge marble steps lead up to the\u001b[K\r\n  Grunting Boar Inn entrance: simple functional furniture, small staircase up to recept\u2026\u001b[2m  [place]\u001b[0m      temple gate.  The entrance to the Clerics Guild is to the west, and the old\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[2mprocedure:\u001b[0m How to approach a place I have never been                                                 Grunting Boar Inn, is to the east.  Just south of here you see the market\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[2mlast change: fact_added fact-0021\u001b[0m                                                                    square, the center of Midgaard.\u001b[K\r\n                                                                                    "]
